    airo:evidenceText "Johansson said Altman offered to hire her last September to voice the ChatGPT 4.0 system." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3665" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e6cca67a2bd4> a airo:Evidence ;
